        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/the_burning_stickman/{size}/2003_2.png",
        "created_at": "2016-04-08T16:03:29.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>My guess it has to do with her not having full control over her magic powers yet. So, more control tokens face up might mean she does more damage to enemies and less to herself, and vice versa, and her spells have you flipping the tokens as you play them.</p>",
