        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/c/e8c25b/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2016-04-08T16:49:03.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Maybe there will be a slight gamble mechanic like Nightmist, only instead the card she draws has to do with the tokens in play. That way the base power has control over what style you use her in.</p>",
