        "username": "The_Burning_Stickman",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/the_burning_stickman/{size}/2003_2.png",
        "created_at": "2016-04-08T17:38:18.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I could also see it working similarly to Nightmist's spell numbers -- something like, \"Destroy up to X environment or ongoing cards, where X equals the number of control tokens face up. Flip one control token for each card destroyed. The Harpy does herself X damage, where X equals the number of control tokens face down.\"</p>",
