      {
        "id": 84670,
        "name": "PePe QuiCoSE",
        "username": "PePe_QuiCoSE",
        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/p/ecae2f/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2016-04-08T21:32:22.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Given the lore, I'd say it represent the control she has over her powers. Like she can spend tokens to summon 1 HP birds like crazy, but then she needs those tokens to have control of them. If it's akin Setback, her base power would increase the number of tokens you have available for play (while Promo makes her more reliable and less burst-y)</p>",
        "post_number": 85,
