      {
        "id": 84671,
        "name": "cadkaupert",
        "username": "cadkaupert",
        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/c/e8c25b/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2016-04-09T03:33:15.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Also noting that she seems to use the same magic as Nightmist, since in the story, it would appear Nightmist is helping take control of her powers. I'm thinking pre-Nightmist, when she first was learning to use her powers, only times 100, since the source of Lillian's magic is an ultra powerful mask. I could see how they could be similar. That would be my theory.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>however, I'd like to see a little bit of setback mechanic in her. It would be a little risky to use her powers uncrontolled, but with more output, whereas you could opt for more control, but less output.</p>",
        "post_number": 86,
        "post_type": 1,
